KingSlime: Defeat the king of the slimes.
EyeofCthulhu: Defeat Cthulhu's eye that was ripped from him centuries ago.
EvilBoss: Defeat the malevolent being that lurks deep in the evil biome.
QueenBee: Defeat the queen that resides in the jungle.
Skeletron: Free the old man from his curse at the entrance of the Dungeon.
Deerclops: Defeat the wandering deer during a blizzard.
WallofFlesh: Defeat the world's guardian that keeps ancient spirits sealed away.
MechBossOne: Defeat one of the mechanical simulacrums of Cthulhu's organs.
MechBossTwo: Defeat two of the mechanical simulacrums of Cthulhu's organs.
MechBossThree: Defeat all of the mechanical simulacrums of Cthulhu's organs.
Plantera: Defeat the jungle's guardian whos span reaches the entire jungle.
Golem: Defeat the Lihzahrd clan'a magnum opus deep inside the Temple.
EmpressofLight: Defeat the fae goddess in the Hallow.
LunaticCultist: Defeat the crazed cultist leader at the entrance of the Dungeon.
MoonLordsCore: Defeat the Moon Lord.
RCT: Be at the brink of death at the hands of the jungle gaurdian.
